# Copy-Pastable Code Blocks

All bash/shell code blocks in markdown files must be directly copy-pastable into a terminal.

- Never put comments inside bash code blocks (they cause weird terminal behavior)
- Never prefix commands with `$` or `#` prompt characters
- Put explanatory text in the prose above or below the code block, not inside it
- Comments in tree/directory structure blocks are also discouraged; use a table below the tree instead
